The current implementation of `get_deferred_factory` only inspects the top-level type. If a field is typed as `Optional[Annotated[...]]` or `Annotated[...] | None`, the marker will be missed. Update the function to recursively inspect `Union` types.

```python
    origin = get_origin(field_type)
    if origin is Annotated:
        for metadata in get_args(field_type)[1:]:
            if isinstance(metadata, _DeferredMarker):
                return metadata
    if origin is Union:
        for arg in get_args(field_type):
            marker = get_deferred_factory(arg)
            if marker:
                return marker
    return None
```
